DTEND:20260914T104040Z
SUMMARY:The Moon occults Venus
DESCRIPTION:Venus disappears at 11:55:41 and reappears at 12:38:25 CEST\, s
 een from Stockholm\, SE.\nThe Moon is 4° up in the SE · daylight\, Sun +
 33°.\nTimes for the Moon's mean limb\, ±2 s.\nMap\, timings and the view
  at the Moon's edge: https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=59.3294
 &lon=18.0687
URL:https://occult.alokm.com/venus-2026-09-14?lat=59.3294&lon=18.0687
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
